CTX_RESTORE at 0x40001000, firmware v1.0: the MK-1's context-restore epilogue as dumped --
the bytes the declaration in ex10 was derived from. Hand-annotated sidecar for fw_v10.bin
(big-endian PPC32, one word per line); eyeball against `make disasm` in this directory.

  801f0000    lwz   r0, 0x0(r31)
  7c0803a6    mtlr  r0
  803f0004    lwz   r1, 0x4(r31)
  83df0050    lwz   r30, 0x50(r31)
  83ff0054    lwz   r31, 0x54(r31)
  4e800020    blr
